		{
			dependencies: ["6FB14354662467B7"]
			description: [
				"The terminal comes with an entangled quantum (bridge card) that is the same as nbt. There are 4 in total (actually you only need two) and the remaining two are used as insurance. You no longer need to explode singularities. The original corresponding tnt, ender pearl powder and singularities in the AE package have been removed."
				""
				"The display component uses a reverse card to block all items and fluids that you do not want to display on the terminal. You can select items in the component workbench controlled by the right-click switch on the terminal."
				""
				"Oh, yes, you also need to bind the network to your terminal first! (wireless access point) otherwise you can't open the terminal"
				"As insurance, after you complete the task, I will give you two more entangled quantums."
