		{
			dependencies: ["6E7F6B0BF32056AF"]
			description: [
				"&5&l=== Final Gathering Hub · Overview of functions ==="
				""
				"&6&lUnlocked in stages: &7Default Max + level (obtained in the Fish Big stage)"
				"&7|| The small store can draw prizes/redeem"
				"&cRecipe Control: &7Enabling low-stage recipes will seriously damage the game balance"
				""
				"&c&l◆ Function bypass: &7formula research/computing power/electricity/gravity/maintenance/minimum time consumption"
				"&a&l◆ Function provided: &7parallel/cross-recipe thread/recipe output multiple/machine function override"
				"&d&l◆ Warehouse mapping: &7optics/computing power/power/maintenance/celestial divergence engine/parallel aggregation warehouse"
				"&7(Comprehensive replacement of all independent warehouses)"
				""
				"Detailed explanation of &n&dbypass function:"
				"&7- Computing power: The hub has a built-in Integer level computing power container"
				"&7- Voltage: The hub can freely adjust the voltage level ( ULV ~ MAX +16)"
				"&7- Environmental conditions: Ignores harsh environmental restrictions such as gravity and strong gravity"
				"&7- Coil Temperature: Hub Camouflage High Warmth Coil"
				"&7- Recipe probability: chancedOutput forces 100% success"
				""
				"&l&a[Second page] View the parallel and threading mechanism of the material module"
				"&l&a[Page 3] Check the hub machine overwrite function"
				"&l&a[Page 4] View thread enhancements"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&l##Pluggable substance module:"
				"&bParallel/threading system: Insert modules to unlock parallelism and threads. The more advanced modules provide more"
				"&aWhen the parallelism of the machine itself is higher than that provided by the hub: the hub parallelism will be superimposed on the original value."
				"The maximum value of &cdoes not exceed Long.MAX_VALUE, otherwise it will overflow."
				""
				"&2entry material module &7[Parallel 128]"
				"&2basic material module &7[Parallel 256]"
				"&2Material deduction module &7[Parallel 512]"
				"&2virtual image material module &7[parallel 1,024]"
				"&2Transmutation Matter Module &7[Parallel 2,048]"
				"&2Dark Star Matter Module &7[Parallel 4,096]"
				"&3material recombination module &7[parallel 16,384]"
				"&3Imaginary matter module &7[Parallel 65,536]"
				"&3Zeroing material module &7[Parallel 524,288]"
				"&3Peak Material Module &7[Parallel 1,048,576]"
				"&3Dimensional material module &7[Parallel 2,097,152]"
				"&4Ultra-limited substance module &7[Parallel 268,435,456]"
				"&4Chaos Matter Module &7[Parallel 536,870,912]"
				"&4Eternal Matter Module &7[Parallel 2,147,483,647]"
				"&5Matter Creation Module &7[Parallel 4.6e18]"
				"&5Reality Anchor Module &7[Parallel 6.9e18]"
				"&5Founded the reality modification module &7[Unlimited Parallel]"
				""
				"&bThe founding reality modification module comes with a 2x recipe output magnification"
				""
				"&cWhen the formula time multiplier is 0.00, it is forced to be classified as 1 tick (0.05s)"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&ldetailed functions:"
				""
				"&elocks 114514h running time when installed into False God Forge and reduces it after removing the hub"
				"&eUnlocks module restrictions when installed into False God - the module no longer requires God Forging to run"
				"&eNever locks the material alienation recipe when installed into a stellar fusion mutator"
				"&9When installed into Hongmeng/Arcane, hydrogen and helium will no longer be consumed when they reach a certain limit."
				"&9add3.1c arcane new function: after the hub is installed in the arcane star map, the star map compression star array output probability is forcibly increased to 100%. No need to put 42000 star arrays in, and directly open the star array compression recipe. For details, please refer to add arcane star map star array compression mechanism."
				"When &ais installed on the sub-module machine (the configuration file needs to be opened), the sub-module is allowed to operate independently from the host machine."
				"&aFor example: Space Elevator Sub-module/Chronospace Sub-module/Satellite Factory/Pseudo God Module/Terminal Engine Module"
				"&c(The hub is no longer needed, the module is changed to global behavior independently)"
				""
				"&6Recipe output multiplier × [1.0~5.0] Creation module + large backlash unlock"
				"&6outputs 1 item ⇒ (increase 5x) 5 items and superimposes gravitational waves ⇒15x"
				"&7Configurable energy voltage level ULV~ MAX +16(long)"
				""
				"&cToo many function mixins will cause slow/abnormal host formation. The host needs to be replayed."
				""
				"The &cconfiguration file can turn on terminal mode: threads are converted to output multipliers"
				"The highest 4G thread (reality modification module) means the highest output multiplier is 4G"
				"Superposition is allowed. The maximum superposition magnification is 40b*15*5*3."
				"(Thread * False God * Hub 5x * Gravitational Wave 3x * Modification Module x2) Total output multiplier of 18000 billion"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&5&l=== Thread enhancement system ==="
				""
				"&6&l[Star array slot] &7— Thread base"
				"&7Ordinary star array &f×1 → 1,046,272 threads/grid"
				"&dcompressed star array &f×1 → 1,607,073,792 threads/grid &7(1536 times)"
				"&dWorld Line Beacon &f×1 → Full Thread Unlocked (Long.MAX_VALUE)"
				""
				"&6&l[Thread Enhancement Slot] &7— Multiplication"
				"&eWorld Line Fragment Lv1 &f×64 → &a×64 magnification"
				"&eWorld Line Fragment Lv2 &f×64 → &a×256 magnification"
				"&eWorld Line Fragment Lv7 &f×64 → &a×262,144 magnification"
				"&dUniversal Parallel Overlimit Device &f→ Parallel/Thread Forced MAX"
				""
				"&6&l[Substance Module Slot] &7— Time consuming + parallelism"
				"&2Getting Started ~ &5Founding &7Total 17 levels → Time consumption multiplier 0.001~0.50"
				"→ Parallel upper limit 256~unlimited (Long.MAX_VALUE)"
				""
				"&5&l[Calculation formula]"
				"&ffinal thread = &6star array base &f× &afragment magnification"
				"&7(upper limit clamp: Long.MAX_VALUE)"
				""
				"&5&l[Example]"
				"&7Star Array×1+Fragment Lv1×64 &f"
				"&6=1,046,272 &f× &a64 &f= &b66,961,408 threads"
				""
				"&7Compressed Star Array×1+Fragment Lv7×64 &f"
				"&6=1,607,073,792 &f× &a262,144 &f= &bThe upper limit has been reached"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "674D4D09E04CCDF1"
			subtitle: "&$ultimate-There is no beginning, no way, and no end. The supreme creation of Blue Star is the concrete existence of fantasy power. It rewrites the laws of the universe under the absolute world line. It is the concession of the universe to Blue Star civilization."
