		{
			dependencies: ["53BFAA5E249A1079"]
			description: [
				"&cThis thing nbt is really too big, put it in AE with caution"
				"&m&aYou can use the IO port to reverse the disk and quickly import it to the me drive for use."
				"&$lava- You don't need drives anymore you can use Super Disk Array and its host Singularity Storage Hub"
				""
				"&l&eflip tutorial:"
				"&eAE IO port allows you to export items in the disk. Normally it can only be exported to another disk, but when combined with the storage bus, it is allowed to be exported to a container linked to the storage bus (the me drive belongs to the container). It is also suitable for pouring things to the aggregator to obtain singularities. It is only recommended to dump in subnets. This is a more general method."
			]
